	(text "MCP2221A USB-UART/I2C (3.3V operation)\\n+3V3 must come from an external LDO (VBUS -> 3.3V), not shown\\nAt VDD = 3.3V, VUSB is tied to VDD per datasheet\\nFor 5V operation: VDD = VBUS, VUSB to 470nF only\\nRST pull-up 10k; I2C pull-ups 4.7k; GP0-3 NC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
